  - key: privacy.title
    value: Privacy
  - key: privacy.body
    value: An account is optional. Progress stays on this device unless a grown-up
      chooses private Google cloud backup. Photos and device settings always stay
      local. Cloud data can be exported, signed out, or deleted from Settings. Google
      sign-in data is never used for advertising. Optional store purchases never
      sell story, science, or accessibility.
