  - key: chapter.opening.title
    value: "THE CLUBHOUSE \xB7 BEFORE DINNER"
  - key: chapter.opening.copy
    value: "Mira \xB7 Juno \xB7 Kai \xB7 Bea \xB7 Ori\nWe\u2019re going exploring!
      We\u2019ll be back before dinner!\nPermission granted. Antenna awake. Signal
      received."
  - key: chapter.opening.beat
    value: "Permission granted. Helmets sealed.\nOri wakes the antenna\u2014the first
      Signal pulse answers."
  - key: chapter.reassembly.title
    value: "THREE FRAGMENTS \xB7 ONE SIGNAL"
  - key: chapter.reassembly.copy
    value: "The crew trusts your route. Rebuild the Signal.\nSTAR MAP: BEYOND AURELIA
      \xB7 RECENT PULSE CONFIRMED"
  - key: chapter.reassembly.beat
    value: "MIRRA \xB7 KORO \xB7 ASTER\nThree fragments align. A route beyond Aurelia
      appears."
  - key: chapter.clubhouse.safe.title
    value: "THE CLUBHOUSE \xB7 SAFE HARBOR"
  - key: chapter.clubhouse.safe.copy
    value: Rest, review the star map, or continue when the crew is ready.
  - key: chapter.clubhouse.return.title
    value: "CLUBHOUSE \xB7 CRASH RETURN"
  - key: chapter.clubhouse.return.copy
    value: "THE SCOUT SKIDS INTO THE CLUBHOUSE.\nEveryone is safe. Grab the fragment\u2014race
      home."
  - key: chapter.clubhouse.birthday
    value: '

      Ori left a birthday delivery and handmade stars.'
  - key: chapter.clubhouse.beat1
    value: "IMPACT ABSORBED \xB7 HULL SAFE\nThe hatch opens. Everyone runs the fragment
      home."
  - key: chapter.clubhouse.beat2
    value: "Across the ridge before the last light\u2014home before dinner."
  - key: chapter.dinner.title
    value: HOME BEFORE DINNER
  - key: chapter.dinner.question
    value: So, did you discover anything?
  - key: chapter.dinner.answer
    value: Just some stars.
  - key: chapter.dinner.copy
    value: "So, did you discover anything?\nJust some stars.\nORI EYE FLICKER \xB7
      POCKET FRAGMENT PULSE\nCHAPTER TWO \xB7 SIGNAL BEYOND AURELIA\nCREDITS"
  - key: chapter.dinner.beat2
    value: "Just some stars.\nOri\u2019s eye flickers. The pocket fragment answers
      once."
  - key: aster.trust.pick
    value: "MIRA \xB7 JUNO \xB7 KAI \xB7 BEA\nYOUR CALL, CAPTAIN. PICK THE LINE."
  - key: aster.trust.withYou
